{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Woodskip is a ",["l","鱼","fish"]," that can be caught in the pond in the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"]," during any season. It is most prevalent there on non-rainy days, with each cast having a 15% to 27% chance to hook a Woodskip depending on ",["l","技能#Fishing","fishing skill"],". The Woodskip is more likely to be caught when casting at least 3 tiles from shore. It can also be caught on the ",["l","农场地图#Forest","Forest Farm"],", with each cast having a 0% to 17.5% chance to hook a Woodskip depending on daily ",["l","运气","luck"],". It can also randomly be found at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 225–1,000g."]]]],["Map",2,[["p",["The Woodskip can be found in the Secret Woods and the Forest Farm."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["The Woodskip is used in the Fish Tank."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","生鱼寿司","Maki Roll"]],["Fish and rice wrapped in seawe